All candidate NPZ checkpoints are exported in `figures/fruit_stream_physics_rl/`.

Trajectory files include the exact 60-second endpoint in addition to the 900
frame-time states. Fruit positions, quaternions and velocities use CAD Z-up
coordinates; quaternions are WXYZ, linear velocity is m/s, angular velocity is
rad/s, and mass is kg. These logs are outputs, never additional policy inputs.
